source_abilities.Q:
Yin swings her whip 1350 units to pull herself to a target or the world;
If the Target is an Enemy, she deals 30/55/80/105/130 (+100% physical power)(+80% magical power) physical damage, Slows them by 90% for 0.6s, and generates 2 stacks of Rising Storm.
She then leaps in a direction of her choice.
